                    CBS_DROPDOWNLIST | WS_VSCROLL | WS_TABSTOP
    LTEXT           "No shift", IDC_PITCH_SUMMARY, 7, 125, 266, 9
    LTEXT           "Moving the pitch without moving the speed means working a window at a time, and the block cannot say anything about a sound until it has a whole window of it - so the delay is the window, and the quality setting is really a choice of how much delay to spend. At no shift at all nothing is built and nothing is delayed.",
                    IDC_PITCH_NOTE, 7, 139, 266, 34
    CONTROL         "Block e&nabled", IDC_BLOCK_ENABLED, "Button",
                    BS_AUTOCHECKBOX | WS_TABSTOP, 7, 181, 200, 12
